**/.DS_Store
/.cache/
/state/
/credentials/
/data/
# AI session plans, handoffs and working reports are local.
**/.agent-work/
**/.superpowers/
**/docs/superpowers/
**/.env
**/.env.local
/infra/site/
/infra/secrets/
/infra/reference/deploy/site/
/infra/reference/deploy/secrets/
/apps/sites/public/
/apps/sites/build/
/apps/sites/.react-router/
/apps/sites/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
/services/catalyst/schema.sql
/services/catalyst/migrations.sql
result
result-*

# The dependency drift map (research, review, rendered site): built locally or as a CI artifact, never committed.
